<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 228 0 R
/E (My project was AgriVision, an AI-powered crop and weed detection system. It uses a fine-tuned YOLO11n object detection model and a Streamlit web dashboard to find crops and weeds in field images, show bounding boxes with confidence scores, and give general crop-protection guidance. On the validation set the model reached 85.1% mAP@50, with 81.9% precision and 78.7% recall.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [16]
>>
