503 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 237 0 R
/E (Proposed solution. AgriVision is a web application built around a fine-tuned YOLO11n object detection model \(Ultralytics, PyTorch\). The user selects the crop, uploads a photo and, if needed, adjusts the confidence threshold, NMS IoU threshold and inference image size. The app returns the annotated image with boxes and confidence scores, the number of crops and weeds, the weed share of all detections, a table of detections with bounding-box coordinates, general crop-protection guidance and an exportable report. It is deployed on Streamlit Community Cloud, so anyone can use it from a browser.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
