/T (Precision of 81.9% means that about 82 of every 100 drawn boxes are correct, and recall of 78.7% means that about 79 of every 100 labelled objects are found. The mAP@50 of 85.1% shows good detection at a loose overlap requirement, while the lower mAP@50-95 of 59.3% shows that boxes are less tight under a stricter one. These values apply to the validation data; real-field results will vary with image quality, lighting, camera angle and field conditions.)
/E (Precision of 81.9% means that about 82 of every 100 drawn boxes are correct, and recall of 78.7% means that about 79 of every 100 labelled objects are found. The mAP@50 of 85.1% shows good detection at a loose overlap requirement, while the lower mAP@50-95 of 59.3% shows that boxes are less tight under a stricter one. These values apply to the validation data; real-field results will vary with image quality, lighting, camera angle and field conditions.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [32]
>>
